NOTICE
======

This product bundles third-party MIB modules. They are reproduced from the
published sources named below with only RFC page furniture removed (running
headers, "[Page N]" footers, form feeds) and the common leading indentation
stripped. No MIB text is altered.

Every file in `Sources/MIBKit/Resources/StandardMIBs/` must appear in a
`- <file>.mib — ...` entry below. `StandardMIBBundleTests` compares the two
mechanically and fails the build if they diverge, which is the check C-9 asks
for: a file present in the bundle but absent from this NOTICE is a defect.

Each entry was checked against its source document on 2026-09-14.


