- TCP-MIB.mib — RFC 4022 — Copyright (C) The Internet Society (2005).
- UDP-MIB.mib — RFC 4113 — Copyright (C) The Internet Society (2005).
- BRIDGE-MIB.mib — RFC 4188 — Copyright (C) The Internet Society (2005).
- IP-MIB.mib — RFC 4293 — Copyright (C) The Internet Society (2006).


