Candidates removed for licence reasons
--------------------------------------

None. Every module in the candidate set enumerated in `docs/bundled-mibs.md` is
redistributable in a paid binary under the terms above, so nothing was dropped on
licensing grounds and no functionality is lost to C-9.

`RFC1213-MIB` is absent from the bundle, but for a technical reason rather than a
licensing one; see `docs/bundled-mibs.md`.
